Except for the rights necessary to exercise a licence that expressly applies to a particular asset, no general licence is granted to publish new or adapted depictions, derivative characters, stories, adventures, or other derivative works based on the Adventures of Patch character and world IP.

This reservation includes, to the extent protected by applicable law, Patch, Bit, Bot, the Heist Crew, other current and future original Adventures of Patch characters, their distinctive designs and identities, and Adventures of Patch names and branding.

